# =============================================================================
#  Build-context filter for the Nx playground app. Build context is
#  `src/PlatformExampleAppWeb` - see src/platform-example-app.docker-compose.yml
#  (`context: PlatformExampleAppWeb`).
#
#  RULE 1 - parity with clean-bravo.cmd: everything that script deletes is
#  regenerable and must never be uploaded. Section headings below name the
#  matching `$dirTargets` category; keep the two lists in sync.
#
#  RULE 2 - no `!` exception lines. A single `!` anywhere disables Docker's
#  skip-the-whole-directory fast path, so the walker would have to stat every
#  file in node_modules, .angular/cache and .nx/cache on every build.
# =============================================================================

# --- clean-bravo: "web build output" -----------------------------------------
**/dist

# --- clean-bravo: "tool cache" -----------------------------------------------
**/.angular
**/.nx
**/.vs
**/.sass-cache
**/.cache

# --- clean-bravo: "npm packages" ---------------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/packages/

# --- clean-bravo: "build output" ---------------------------------------------
**/bin
**/obj
**/out/

# --- clean-bravo: "test results / crash dumps" -------------------------------
**/TestResults
**/testresults
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/*.dmp
**/*.trx

# --- clean-bravo: "benchmark output" -----------------------------------------
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts

# --- Nx scratch output (git-ignored by the root .gitignore `tmp/` rule) ------
tmp

# --- VCS / IDE / tooling metadata --------------------------------------------
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user
**/.toolstarget
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/npm-debug.log
**/yarn-error.log

# --- Docker / deployment definitions (never needed inside an image) ---------
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*
**/azds.yaml
**/charts
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml

# --- Local credentials / private key material --------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
